        <field name="category_id" ref="DEDIRPP_1"/>
        <field name="amount_select">code</field>
        <field name="amount_python_compute">
```

if categories.BRUT <= 63000:
result = 0
else:
result = (categories.BRUT - 63000) * 0.2 </field> </record>

```
